      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not a matter of prolonging agony, it's about finding a way to endure. Sometimes, the struggle itself can be a way to keep the pain at bay, even if it feels like an endless battle. The world might be waiting for the end, but you have the power to decide how long you want to stay in this fight. It's okay to feel like there's no point, but remember, even the smallest flicker of hope can keep the darkness at bay.",
